  </ul>
  <p>The <a href="PRODUCTION.md">claim register</a> records the audit of the previous page. The <a href="README.md">methods and rebuild commands</a>, the <a href="evidence_inputs.json">transcribed source tables</a>, the <a href="out/pgm_chain.json">evidence and calculations</a> and the <a href="out/pgm_trade.json">frozen trade extract</a> give the underlying data. The earlier <a href="library">source library</a> is kept as a dated record.</p>
